{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36702","headline":"秋日泊平望驿寄太常裴郎中 · 罗隐","name":"秋日泊平望驿寄太常裴郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苹洲重到杳难期，西倚邮亭忆往时。\n北海尊中常有酒，东阳楼上岂无诗。\n地清每负生灵望，官重方升礼乐司。\n闻说江南旧歌曲，至今犹自唱吴姬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36702.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36702","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}